{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/4f6d8ef46206fe167220b44ceb248aed.avif?t=1756249474\" width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start your adventure deep inside the <strong>Aka-Ramba Cave</strong>, a lovely place full of danger, Your goal? <strong>Get out..!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you\u2019re not totally alone, you\u2019ll meet\u00a0<strong>Liba-Riba a brave explorer</strong>, who may or may not be helpful. She\u2019ll throw some clues in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this Demo!</strong><br><strong>Demo Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0b 1 Prototype Level</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0\u2694 \u00a02 Different Weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0\ud83c\udf31 3 Primal Seed (Abilities)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd47 6 Improvement Charms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc1e 6 Different Enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc4a 1 Challenging Boss</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to fight, upgrade, and probably die a little. Let the chaos begin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/46910fb88d21e0ecb3966cb4c0462acd.avif?t=1756249474\" width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/250fc2fb5cf385b97aa46832a5a91276.avif?t=1756249474\" width=800 height=140 /></span>UNGALAND combines action-adventure, and platforming with exploring a vast, cartoon-styled world to discover the island is full of life and surprises at every corner. Explore the different paths packed with enemies and get ready to face them head-on with a<strong> WILD</strong> arsenal of weapons only you can wield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the dangers deep within the island of <strong>Wa-Kabum</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden by overcoming each trial thrown your way; it\u2019s up to you to face these dangers head-on and return victorious Not as the <strong>Hero</strong> they seek, but as the <strong>Brute</strong> they need.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.poster.avif?t=1756249474\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.webm?t=1756249474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.mp4?t=1756249474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858630?t=1756249474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858630?t=1756249474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/d0766581385a185a7f78e1b3062122d00f597898/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756249474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858630/d0766581385a185a7f78e1b3062122d00f597898/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756249474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"control